msgid ""
"The job syncs tiers, protects staff identities first, then walks members. "
"Re-running is safe; webhooks and Ghost sign-in keep future changes in sync."
msgstr ""
"De taak synchroniseert de niveaus, beschermt eerst de identiteiten van de "
